== General ==
Daily Rewards is a feature allowing the player to get {{Keyword|soul|Souls|link=Soul_Shop}} and {{Keyword|tf|Time Flux|link=Time_Flux}} by entering the game once a day. 

It usually rewards {{time_flux|Time Flux|front=y|ico=y}} and {{souls|Souls|front=y|ico=y}}

Average souls gained ≈ {{souls|+232|size=20px|ico=y}}/day

Average time flux gained ≈ {{time_flux|+9:17|size=20px|ico=y}}/day

There are 14 days with different rewards:
