== Daily Streaks ==

* As of v1.058, the ability to have Daily Streaks, where as long as you log-in and claim a reward each day, you can accumulate a streak.
* Each day you grow your streak, you gain a +5% gain to Daily Rewards (Limited to Souls) up to +50% at Day 10.
* With this you get average around 348/day.

== Trivia ==

* The reward progress does not reset. If you miss a day, you can come back and continue from the same place
* After getting all the achievements, this is the best way to get souls for free
* You can leave the reward 'chests' unopened and still get new rewards by opening the menu. This allows you to get multiple rewards at once. <!--but why? idk   -Li -->

